  "reflectionText": "Nebuchadnezzar boasted on the roof, was driven out into the field for seven seasons with hair like eagles' feathers, and at the end of the seventh lifted up his eyes to the sky. What is the restoration of a man who comes back into the palace with the field still clinging to him?"
